{"version":1,"content":"<p>容祖兒明年1月在啟德主場館舉行合共3場演唱會，她昨天（19日）聯同林家謙到商台叱咤樂壇直播，力谷新歌《陽光普照》，湊巧陳奕迅（Eason）昨天也在商台接受鄭裕玲（Do姐）《口水多過浪花》直播訪問及《Bad Girl大過佬》錄音訪問，宣傳他今年12月至明年2月，在香港演藝學院歌劇院舉行26場《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan 與陳奕迅一起錄音》。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:21:22.521275+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:51:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:17:39.871684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:17:45.729107+00:00","content_hash":"bc9e5cb5ecb56a49daae76f07fdebb4f19727d34e5548a091d6676edb90a4ca8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}